DFP, input schedule & equals the A--B gap & $\le10^{-14}$\\
Oustaloup parallel, hot swap & $4\times10^{-6}$ to $0.13$ & $7\times10^{-3}$ to $1.0$\\
Oustaloup cascade, hot swap & $7\times10^{-3}$ to $3.0\times10^{3}$ & $0.03$ to $4.8\times10^{2}$\\
